### What is the low-level design?

```text
  ═══ LLD — Palindrome Partitioning ═══

  ┌─ Technique ──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  try every prefix cut; keep palindromic ones; recurse     │
  │  precompute isPal[i][j] → O(1) checks (optimization)      │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  ┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
  │   ReferenceSegmenter                  │
  │  + partition(s): List<List<String>>   │ O(n·2^n)
  │  - backtrack(s,start,path,result)     │
  │  - isPalindrome(s,lo,hi): boolean     │
  └───────────────────────────────────────┘
```

